    "slug": "instagram-reels-to-whatsapp-funnel-math-indian-local-brands",
    "title": "Instagram Reels to WhatsApp Funnel Math for Indian Local Brands: Turning ₹3,000 Ad Budgets into Repeat UPI Orders",
    "date": "November 16, 2026",
