    "slug": "d2c-packaging-inserts-whatsapp-reorder-qr-unit-economics-india",
    "title": "Indian D2C Packaging Inserts & WhatsApp Reorder QR Funnels: How Repeat-Customer Math Cuts Blended CAC in Half",
