    "slug": "gst-invoicing-cgst-sgst-igst-upi-qr-guide",
    "title": "GST Invoicing for Small Businesses & Freelancers: CGST vs SGST vs IGST, HSN Codes, and UPI QR Collections",
    "category": "Operations",
